{"id":"A2-L031","title":"Past Continuous × Past Simple: practice and contrast","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U02","focus":"Contraste Past Continuous + Past Simple — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Contraste Past Continuous + Past Simple — prática e contraste","pron":"gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["grab","fit","enormous","blazer","doors","imagine","storefront","opening","changing room","sizes","stampede","sale rack","bag check","staff member","spare","sale rush"],"field":"Compras","genre":"E-mail, carta, mensagem","skill":"Leitura","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 31 · Past Continuous × Past Simple: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Contraste Past Continuous + Past Simple — prática e contraste.","**Pronúncia:** gonna e wanna (reconhecimento).","**16 palavras novas** (compras).","**Texto do dia:** e-mail, carta, mensagem."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo contrastar passado simples e contínuo num e-mail."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["grab","pegar rápido"],["fit","servir"],["enormous","gigantesco"],["blazer","blazer"],["doors","portas"],["imagine","imaginar"],["storefront","fachada de loja"],["opening","abertura"],["changing room","changing room"],["sizes","sizes"],["stampede","stampede"],["sale rack","sale rack"],["bag check","bag check"],["staff member","staff member"],["spare","spare"],["sale rush","sale rush"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An e-mail","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"ana@mail.com","to":"leo@mail.com","subject":"Sale story!","paras":["Hi Leo!","Guess what! I **was walking** past the mall when I **saw** a huge sale. People **were running**, and the doors **were opening**. I **grabbed** a coat, but it **didn’t fit**.","While I **was waiting** in line, a stranger **offered** me his place. We **talked** for an hour! Ana"],"gloss":[["grab","pegar rápido"],["fit","servir"],["place","lugar"],["doors","portas"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ana was walking past the mall.","ans":"T","why":"was walking."},{"q":"The coat fit.","ans":"F","why":"didn’t fit."},{"q":"A stranger offered his place.","ans":"T","why":"offered me his place."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“grab” = ?","opts":["pegar rápido","soltar","trocar"],"ans":0,"why":"grab."},{"q":"“fit” = ?","opts":["servir (tamanho)","caber nada","comprar"],"ans":0,"why":"fit."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Simple × Continuous: practice","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pergunta","Resposta"],"rows":[["**What were you doing?**","**I was waiting in line.**"],["**What happened?**","**A stranger offered me his place.**"],["**Were you running?**","**No, I wasn’t.**"]],"cap":"Simple × Continuous: practice"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Narre: **cena (contínuo) → evento (simples) → resultado (simples)**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ past the mall. (walk)","a":"was walking","why":"cena."},{"s":"I ___ a huge sale. (see)","a":"saw","why":"evento."},{"s":"The coat ___ fit. (not)","a":"didn’t","why":"didn’t."},{"s":"We ___ for an hour. (talk)","a":"talked","why":"simples."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["grab","pegar rápido"],["fit","servir"],["passerby","transeunte"],["line","fila"],["enormous","gigantesco"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["saw","a","huge","sale","I"],"ans":"I saw a huge sale","pt":"Vi uma grande promoção."},{"words":["you","buy","anything","Did"],"ans":"Did you buy anything","pt":"Comprou algo?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"grab","pos":"word","pt":"pegar rápido","ex":"Grab a coat.","expt":"Pegue um casaco."},{"w":"fit","pos":"word","pt":"servir","ex":"It fits me.","expt":"Serve em mim."},{"w":"enormous","pos":"word","pt":"gigantesco","ex":"An enormous sale.","expt":"Uma promoção gigantesca."},{"w":"blazer","pos":"word","pt":"blazer","ex":"A navy blazer.","expt":"Um blazer azul-marinho."},{"w":"doors","pos":"word","pt":"portas","ex":"Doors opened.","expt":"As portas abriram."},{"w":"imagine","pos":"word","pt":"imaginar","ex":"Imagine that!","expt":"Imagine só!"},{"w":"storefront","pos":"word","pt":"fachada de loja","ex":"A bright storefront.","expt":"Uma fachada de loja iluminada."},{"w":"opening","pos":"word","pt":"abertura","ex":"The grand opening.","expt":"A grande inauguração."},{"w":"changing room","pos":"word","pt":"changing room","ex":"provador","expt":"The changing room."},{"w":"sizes","pos":"word","pt":"sizes","ex":"tamanhos","expt":"All sizes."},{"w":"stampede","pos":"word","pt":"stampede","ex":"debandada","expt":"A shopping stampede."},{"w":"sale rack","pos":"word","pt":"sale rack","ex":"arara de promoção","expt":"Look at the sale rack."},{"w":"bag check","pos":"word","pt":"bag check","ex":"guarda-volumes","expt":"Leave it at bag check."},{"w":"staff member","pos":"word","pt":"staff member","ex":"funcionário","expt":"A staff member helps."},{"w":"spare","pos":"word","pt":"spare","ex":"reserva","expt":"A spare size."},{"w":"sale rush","pos":"word","pt":"sale rush","ex":"correria da promoção","expt":"A sale rush."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What happened?** — O que aconteceu?","**I saw a huge sale.** — Vi uma grande promoção.","**Did you buy anything?** — Comprou algo?","**This one’s on me.** — Esta é por minha conta.","**I’m stuffed.** — Estou cheio.","**I’m exhausted.** — Estou exausto.","**I’m so tired.** — Estou muito cansado."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"climb","pt":"escalar","forms":[["I / you / we / they climb","I climb hills."],["he / she / it climbs","She climbs trees."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Telling a story","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Telling a story","lines":[["Ana","Guess what! I was walking past the mall.","Adivinhe! Eu passava pelo shopping."],["Leo","What happened?","O que aconteceu?"],["Ana","I saw a huge sale.","Vi uma grande promoção."],["Leo","Did you buy anything?","Comprou algo?"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","items":[{"label":"gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","note":"Na fala: going to → gonna, want to → wanna. Reconheça; na escrita use a forma completa.","words":["I’m gonna go","I wanna eat","What are you gonna do?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Tell a short story with simples and contínuo.","pt":"Conte.","model":"I was walking when I saw a sale."},{"q":"Ask: What happened?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"What happened?"},{"q":"Say what didn’t fit.","pt":"Diga.","model":"The coat didn’t fit."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write an 6-line e-mail telling a story.","model":"Hi Leo! I was walking past the mall when I saw a huge sale. People were running. I grabbed a coat, but it didn’t fit. While I was waiting, a stranger offered me his place. We talked for an hour.","checklist":["Usei **was walking**","Usei **when/while**","Usei **simples**"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “grab” mean?","opts":["servir","fila","pegar rápido"],"ans":2,"why":"**grab** = pegar rápido."},{"q":"What does “fit” mean?","opts":["servir","transeunte","gigantesco"],"ans":0,"why":"**fit** = servir."},{"q":"What does “passerby” mean?","opts":["fila","transeunte","blazer"],"ans":1,"why":"**passerby** = transeunte."},{"q":"What does “line” mean?","opts":["gigantesco","portas","fila"],"ans":2,"why":"**line** = fila."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}